{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rooster Rampage</strong></h2>Rooster Rampage is a chicken based zombie shooter about an all-out war to save human-kind!!!<br>Engage your inner chicken in the single player campaign to fend off hordes of zombies across amazing chicken inspired worlds, or locate a nearby Rampage in action!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/ce80398135cba475a1fe403c72c8e7f4.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Zombies Hordes appear</strong></h2>Experience the ultimate combination of chicken and physics in Rooster Rampage the next leap in chicken based combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.poster.avif?t=1627918481\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.webm?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1308960/extras/53e73d922e07259fc6730fc3cea7884f.mp4?t=1627918481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Armed to the Beak</strong></h2>Armed with chicken based firepower and the grit to erase all zombies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: